# Python 3.15.2's `cmath.rect` on this machine, 2026-11-17, at the 49 pairings of seven sizes and seven angles, then at 16 random ones; where Python raises, the values `from_polar` documents.
test "from_polar (generated): every pairing of seven sizes and seven angles, then 16 random ones"
    inf = limits.INF
    nan = limits.NAN
    cases: [[f64]] = [
        [-inf, -inf, inf, nan]
        [-inf, -1.5, -inf, inf]
        [-inf, -0.0, -inf, 0.0]
